{"seq":9,"slug":"lc0061-rotate-list","title":"LeetCode 61 旋转链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0061-rotate-list","wordCount":768,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-61-旋转链表\">LeetCode 61 旋转链表</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个链表的头节点 <code>head</code>，旋转链表，将链表每个节点向右移动 <code>k</code> 个位置。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1,2,3,4,5]</code>, <code>k = 2</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[4,5,1,2,3]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [0,1,2]</code>, <code>k = 4</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[2,0,1]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点的数目在范围 <code>[0, 500]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= k &lt;= 2 * 10^9</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本题的关键观察是：当 k 大于链表长度 n 时，实际旋转次数等于 <code>k % n</code>。此外，向右旋转 k 步等价于将链表末尾 k 个节点移到链表头部，这可以通过「成环后断开」来实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"核心观察\">核心观察</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>k 取模</strong>：旋转 n 次等于不旋转，因此有效旋转次数为 <code>k % n</code></li>\n<li><strong>等价操作</strong>：向右旋转 k 步 = 将链表从倒数第 k 个节点处断开，后半部分接到前半部分前面</li>\n<li><strong>成环思路</strong>：先将链表首尾相连形成环，然后在正确位置断开</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"成环断开法\">成环断开法</h3><p>具体步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>遍历链表，计算长度 <code>n</code>，同时找到尾节点 <code>tail</code></li>\n<li>计算有效旋转 <code>k = k % n</code>，若 <code>k === 0</code> 则无需旋转</li>\n<li>将尾节点的 <code>next</code> 指向 <code>head</code>，形成循环链表</li>\n<li>从 <code>tail</code> 出发，向前走 <code>n - k</code> 步，到达新的尾节点位置</li>\n<li>新的头节点就是新尾节点的下一个节点</li>\n<li>断开环：新尾节点的 <code>next</code> 置为 <code>null</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么从 tail 开始走 n-k 步？</strong> 因为 tail 已经在链表末尾（位置 n-1），向右旋转 k 步后，新的尾节点应该在原链表的第 <code>n-k-1</code> 个位置。从 tail 出发走 <code>n-k</code> 步（经过 head 绕回来）恰好到达这个位置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>k 值</th>\n<th>有效旋转</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>k &lt; n</td>\n<td>k = 2, n = 5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>正常旋转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k = n</td>\n<td>k = 5, n = 5</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k &gt; n</td>\n<td>k = 7, n = 5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>等价于 k=2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k = 0</td>\n<td>k = 0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, next?: ListNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.next = next ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function rotateRight(head: ListNode | null, k: number): ListNode | null {&#10;  if (head === null || head.next === null || k === 0) {&#10;    return head;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let length = 1;&#10;  let tail = head;&#10;  while (tail.next !== null) {&#10;    tail = tail.next;&#10;    length++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  k = k % length;&#10;  if (k === 0) {&#10;    return head;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  tail.next = head;&#10;&#10;  let newTail = tail;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; length - k; i++) {&#10;    newTail = newTail.next!;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const newHead = newTail.next;&#10;  newTail.next = null;&#10;&#10;  return newHead;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rotateRight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> length </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tail.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tail.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tail.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newTail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tail;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> length </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    newTail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newTail.next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newHead</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newTail.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  newTail.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newHead;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>head = [1,2,3,4,5]</code>，<code>k = 2</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>遍历求长度</td>\n<td>n=5, tail=节点5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>k % n</td>\n<td>k=2%5=2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>tail.next = head</td>\n<td>环：1→2→3→4→5→1→...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>从 tail 走 n-k=3 步</td>\n<td>tail→1→2→3，newTail=节点3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>newHead = newTail.next</td>\n<td>newHead=节点4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>newTail.next = null</td>\n<td>断环：4→5→1→2→3→null</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终结果：<code>[4,5,1,2,3]</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"边界情况分析\">边界情况分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>空链表或单节点</strong>：直接返回，无需旋转</li>\n<li><strong>k 为 0</strong>：无需旋转</li>\n<li><strong>k 是 n 的倍数</strong>：<code>k % n === 0</code>，无需旋转</li>\n<li><strong>k 远大于 n</strong>：如 k = 2000000000，n = 3，实际旋转 2 步</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>两次遍历：求长度 O(n) + 找断点 O(n-k)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用常数个指针变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 第一次遍历求链表长度需要 O(n)。第二次从 tail 出发走 <code>n-k</code> 步，最坏情况 k=1 时走 n-1 步。总共最多 2n-1 步，即 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 仅使用 <code>tail</code>、<code>newTail</code>、<code>newHead</code> 等常数个指针变量，不需要额外数据结构。</p>\n<p>成环断开是处理链表旋转/移位问题的标准技巧。理解这个模式后，类似的旋转数组问题（LC #189）也可以用相同的思路来思考（虽然数组通常用三次反转法）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 61 旋转链表","id":"leetcode-61-旋转链表"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"核心观察","id":"核心观察"},{"level":3,"text":"成环断开法","id":"成环断开法"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":3,"text":"边界情况分析","id":"边界情况分析"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 24 两两交换链表中的节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0024-swap-nodes-in-pairs"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 82 删除排序链表中的重复元素 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0082-remove-duplicates-sorted-list-ii"}}